WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,750
We promised that dogs should not look at each other if they are rich or noble.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:04,150
Yoyo, you are so kind

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,750
I'll be with you forever

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:09,170
this necklace

5
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:10,770
Miss Su also took a fancy to it

6
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:12,970
She found out about the dog generation

7
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:15,370
I'm afraid that's not good, isn't it?

8
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:17,370
Your baby is really hit on the head

9
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:19,170
Ms. Su has lived for generations.

10
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:20,570
But there is no reservation at all

11
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:22,570
How could it be possible for her to be a customer?

12
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:24,170
