17
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,170
Anyone can come to work

18
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:35,030
Including a pig Wan Wan

19
00:00:35,030 --> 00:00:36,430
Haven't seen you for some days

20
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:38,630
tough uncle and aunt

21
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:41,030
