22
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:42,430
Give a dog generations

23
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:43,830
You are slapping me in the face

24
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:45,830
Or slap our Su family in the face?

25
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:47,780
My big order, my commission

26
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:48,980
my bonus

27
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,180
Don't dare to open my eyes

28
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,580
