38
00:01:14,610 --> 00:01:15,840
Miss Su

39
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:18,550
Please inform your parents on your behalf

40
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:21,180
The innovative drug cooperation project between our two companies

41
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:23,380
I don't think it's necessary to go any further.
